---
title: "Update an agent profile"
icon: pencil
description: "Update an agent profile: updateAgentProfile in the TypeScript, Python and Rust clients."
---

`PATCH /v1/projects/{projectId}/agent-profile`

Updates the supplied firstName and lastName fields in the project's agent profile and returns the updated profile. Avatar upload, commit and reset are separate operations. The caller must be authorized to change configuration for the selected project. Supply the required Idempotency-Key header.

<Tabs>
<Tab title="TypeScript">
```typescript TypeScript
photon.projects.agentProfile.update(input: UpdateAgentProfileInput, options?: RequestOptions): Promise<UpdateAgentProfileOutput>
```
</Tab>
<Tab title="Python">
```python Python
photon.projects.agent_profile.update(input: UpdateAgentProfileInput) -> models.AgentProfile
```
</Tab>
